{
  "behaviour": "A quantity offers the units `questionnaire-unitOption` permits, and its answer carries value, unit, system and code; a value with no unit fails validation (AC-01.2.4, M5 plan D6). A unit option on another type is an inapplicable constraint (INV-D-20)",
